h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">经文出处</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：חֲנִית</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：chanith)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09013019\" data-end-ref=\"09013019\">1SA 13:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09013022\" data-end-ref=\"09013022\">1SA 13:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017007\" data-end-ref=\"09017007\">1SA 17:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017007\" data-end-ref=\"09017007\">1SA 17:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017045\" data-end-ref=\"09017045\">1SA 17:45</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017047\" data-end-ref=\"09017047\">1SA 17:47</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09018010\" data-end-ref=\"09018010\">1SA 18:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09018011\" data-end-ref=\"09018011\">1SA 18:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09019009\" data-end-ref=\"09019009\">1SA 19:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09019010\" data-end-ref=\"09019010\">1SA 19:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09019010\" data-end-ref=\"09019010\">1SA 19:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09020033\" data-end-ref=\"09020033\">1SA 20:33</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09021009\" data-end-ref=\"09021009\">1SA 21:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09022006\" data-end-ref=\"09022006\">1SA 22:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026008\" data-end-ref=\"09026008\">1SA 26:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026012\" data-end-ref=\"09026012\">1SA 26:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026016\" data-end-ref=\"09026016\">1SA 26:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026022\" data-end-ref=\"09026022\">1SA 26:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09026022\" data-end-ref=\"09026022\">1SA 26:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10001006\" data-end-ref=\"10001006\">2SA 1:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10002023\" data-end-ref=\"10002023\">2SA 2:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10002023\" data-end-ref=\"10002023\">2SA 2:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10021019\" data-end-ref=\"10021019\">2SA 21:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023007\" data-end-ref=\"10023007\">2SA 23:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023018\" data-end-ref=\"10023018\">2SA 23:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023021\" data-end-ref=\"10023021\">2SA 23:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023021\" data-end-ref=\"10023021\">2SA 23:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023021\" data-end-ref=\"10023021\">2SA 23:21</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12011010\" data-end-ref=\"12011010\">2KI 11:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011011\" data-end-ref=\"13011011\">1CH 11:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011020\" data-end-ref=\"13011020\">1CH 11:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011023\" data-end-ref=\"13011023\">1CH 11:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011023\" data-end-ref=\"13011023\">1CH 11:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011023\" data-end-ref=\"13011023\">1CH 11:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13012035\" data-end-ref=\"13012035\">1CH 12:35</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13020005\" data-end-ref=\"13020005\">1CH 20:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14023009\" data-end-ref=\"14023009\">2CH 23:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18039023\" data-end-ref=\"18039023\">JOB 39:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18041018\" data-end-ref=\"18041018\">JOB 41:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19035003\" data-end-ref=\"19035003\">PSA 35:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19046010\" data-end-ref=\"19046010\">PSA 46:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"19057005\" data-end-ref=\"19057005\">PSA 57:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23002004\" data-end-ref=\"23002004\">ISA 2:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"33004003\" data-end-ref=\"33004003\">MIC 4:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"34003003\" data-end-ref=\"34003003\">NAM 3:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"35003011\" data-end-ref=\"35003011\">HAB 3:11</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：רֹמַח</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：romach)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04025007\" data-end-ref=\"04025007\">NUM 25:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"07005008\" data-end-ref=\"07005008\">JDG 5:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"11018028\" data-end-ref=\"11018028\">1KI 18:28</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13012009\" data-end-ref=\"13012009\">1CH 12:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13012025\" data-end-ref=\"13012025\">1CH 12:25</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14011012\" data-end-ref=\"14011012\">2CH 11:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14014007\" data-end-ref=\"14014007\">2CH 14:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14025005\" data-end-ref=\"14025005\">2CH 25:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14026014\" data-end-ref=\"14026014\">2CH 26:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16004007\" data-end-ref=\"16004007\">NEH 4:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16004010\" data-end-ref=\"16004010\">NEH 4:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"16004015\" data-end-ref=\"16004015\">NEH 4:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24046004\" data-end-ref=\"24046004\">JER 46:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26039009\" data-end-ref=\"26039009\">EZK 39:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29004010\" data-end-ref=\"29004010\">JOL 4:10</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：שֵׁבֶט</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：shevet)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10018014\" data-end-ref=\"10018014\">2SA 18:14</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：γαῖσος</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：gaisos)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">JDT 9:7</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：δεξιολάβος</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：dexiolabos)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44023023\" data-end-ref=\"44023023\">ACT 23:23</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：δορά, δόρυ</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：dora, doru)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">JDT 7:10, JDT 11:2, ESG 8:12, SIR 29:13, 3MA 3:15, 3MA 5:43, 3MA 6:5</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：κάμαξ</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：kamax)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">2MA 5:3</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：κέντρον</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：kentron)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">4MA 14:19</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：λόγχη</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：logchē)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43019034\" data-end-ref=\"43019034\">JHN 19:34</data>, 2MA 5:2, 2MA 15:11</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：σιβύνη</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：sibunē (zibunē))</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">JDT 1:15</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Latin</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">拉：framea</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\">2ES 13:9, 2ES 13:28</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>在一根长而直的杆棒上面安装一个锐利的尖端，就做成了长枪，主要攻击方式是刺。枪杆的粗细略小于人手的虎口长度，长度差不多是一个人的身高或者更长。枪杆一般木制，配上金属枪头或枪尖（参<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">2.5.1 枪头(spearhead)&lt;REALIA:2.5.1&gt;</a> ）。枪的尾端（枪纂）也用金属包裹，带尖（参<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10002023\" data-end-ref=\"10002023\">2SA 2:23</data> ），可以用来把枪戳在地上，或者用作刺棒来驱赶牲畜。</p>\n<p>参<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">2.3.1 鞘(sheath, scabbard)&lt;REALIA:2.3.1&gt;</a> 中的插图。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">用途</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>打仗时，持枪的人握着枪杆的中间部位，用力刺向敌人，只偶尔用抛掷的方式来攻击对方（参<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"\" data-key=\"\" href=\"#\">2.6 投枪、标枪、短枪 (javelin)&lt;REALIA:2.6&gt;</a> ）。</p>\n<hr/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻译</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>翻译者在选择字词或短语时，应该尽量表明枪是一种用手握持和用来戳刺的武器（就像一柄固定在棍棒末端的刀那样使用），而不是通过投掷来伤敌。</p>\n<p>短语“举起他的枪”出现在<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10023018\" data-end-ref=\"10023018\">2SA 23:18</data> 和<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13011011\" data-end-ref=\"13011011\">1CH 11:11</data> 。译作“他持枪作战”（<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Good News Translation (1992)\">GNT</abbr> 直译）意思是正确的。</p>\n<p>希腊文<em>dexiolabos</em> 在<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44023023\" data-end-ref=\"44023023\">ACT 23:23</data> 的意思不能确定，大多数译本将其译成“长枪手”（“spearmen”；<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Revised Standard Version (1952)\">RSV</abbr> 、<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New International Version (1984)\">NIV</abbr> ）、“持枪的歩兵”（“foot soldiers with spears”；<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Contemporary English Version\">CEV</abbr> ）、“持枪的人”（“men with spears”；<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"New Century Version\">NCV</abbr> ），或“轻装备部队”（“light-armed troops”；<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"Revised English Bible (1989)\">REB</abbr> ）。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
